# Cloudblazer: "When this creature enters, you gain 2 life and draw two cards" is one life-gain event (CR 119.9), so with Bot1's
# Drogskol Reaver ("Whenever you gain life, draw a card") out it triggers the Reaver once: two cards from Cloudblazer and one more
# from the Reaver. Bot1 casts both on turn 1 off four Black Lotuses; the one card left in hand becomes four.

